# Nested Conditionals & Guard Clauses 🛡️

You can nest `if` statements inside other `if` blocks:

```javascript
let isLoggedIn = true;
let isVipMember = true;

if (isLoggedIn) {
  if (isVipMember) {
    console.log("Welcome to exclusive VIP content!");
  } else {
    console.log("Welcome standard member!");
  }
} else {
  console.log("Please log in.");
}
```

