# The `while` Loop 🔄

The `while` loop repeats code as long as a specified condition evaluates to `true`:

```javascript
let energy = 100;

while (energy > 20) {
  console.log(`Current energy: ${energy}% - Running...`);
  energy -= 30; // Must update condition variable to prevent infinite loop!
}

console.log(`Exited loop. Final energy: ${energy}%`);
```

<!-- FULL_CODE_START
