# Object Key Iteration: `for...in` 🔑

`for...in` iterates over the **enumerable property keys** of an object:

```javascript
const userProfile = {
  name: "Sarah",
  role: "Lead Architect",
  experienceYears: 8
};

for (const key in userProfile) {
  console.log(`${key}: ${userProfile[key]}`);
}
```

