FULL_CODE_END -->

> ⚠️ **Rule of Thumb:** Use `for...of` for **arrays and collections** (values). Use `for...in` for **plain objects** (keys).

# Nested Loops & Multi-Dimensional Data 📐

Loops can be nested inside other loops to process matrices, tables, and 2D coordinate grids:

```javascript
for (let row = 1; row <= 3; row++) {
  for (let col = 1; col <= 3; col++) {
    console.log(`Cell [${row}, ${col}]`);
  }
}
```

